MARS SECRETS
============

Secrets in this directory are committed only as age-encrypted ciphertext.
The private age identity stays outside Git in:

    .secrets/fred.agekey

Tracked files:

    secrets/fred.env.age             encrypted FRED environment
    secrets/fred.env.age.recipient   public age recipient

Decrypt into the repo-local .env file:

    secrets/bin/unlock-fred-env.sh

Re-encrypt after changing .env:

    secrets/bin/lock-fred-env.sh

Install age on macOS:

    brew install age

If this repo is cloned onto another machine, copy .secrets/fred.agekey through
a private channel, or generate a new age identity and re-encrypt the secret.
